        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld wöchentliche behalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep terminal sessions": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminal-Sitzungen behalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the clock in sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uhr synchron halten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the last 100 MB of logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behält die letzten 100 MB Logs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept for %lld days. Swipe a dump to test it or restore it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird %lld Tage aufbewahrt. Wische über einen Dump, um ihn zu testen oder wiederherzustellen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept on the server in %@. Your own-key agent reads it every time and can add to it; Claude Code and Codex are pointed to it as well. Never put secrets here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Liegt auf dem Server in %@. Dein Agent mit eigenem Key liest es jedes Mal und kann ergänzen; Claude Code und Codex werden ebenfalls darauf hingewiesen. Leg hier nie Geheimnisse ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kernel and library updates only protect you after a restart.": {
